<title>POLAND: Irena Q2 net rises to PLN 1.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Irena Q2 net rises to PLN 1.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irena preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			2.92  vs    0.30</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  3.07  vs    1.70</p>
<p>    net profit				1.94  vs    1.35</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Huta Szkla Gospodarczego Irena SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				17.91  vs   13.73</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  9.56  vs    9.26</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		  0.00  vs    0.45</p>
<p>    income tax				3.07  vs    1.70</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    3.01  vs    0.99</p>
<p>    financial costs			 2.86  vs    0.07</p>
<p>    investment			     10.93  vs    3.53</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			4.74  vs    1.08</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  5.83  vs    3.70</p>
<p>    net profit				3.94  vs    2.74</p>
<p>    net sales				32.30  vs   26.08</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 22.11  vs   20.82</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		  0.00  vs    0.46</p>
<p>    income tax				1.90  vs    0.96</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    7.56  vs    2.44</p>
<p>    financial costs			 6.47  vs    0.28</p>
<p>    investment			     20.07  vs    3.70</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
